      "type": "about-text-grid",
      "settings": {
        "text_1": "<p>As a niche beauty and style digital creator, Nikol has built a community of over 2.2 million followers across her social platforms and amasses 233 million views on her YouTube channel. Her beauty, style and wellness content reaches hundreds of thousands of women seeking a fresh perspective in the evolving shift from anti-aging to pro-aging. Nikol has completed collaborations with Caudalie, Pantene, M.M. LaFleur, St. John, Elemis, La Mer, Estee Lauder, and HSN to name a few.</p>",
        "text_2": "<p>Nikol is based out of South Florida and is slightly obsessed with her two French Bulldogs.</p>",
